        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"e1b9d3be-805a-44da-9fe7-0f4aba38bb22\",\"review_text\":\"I boycoot\"},{\"review_id\":\"d0221553-e9ae-447e-8e27-270c5bfce1b2\",\"review_text\":\"I got an offer of 360 rupees for an year :)\"},{\"review_id\":\"72a250cb-7a3a-4158-b9f1-ad7ead354094\",\"review_text\":\"Great service had some issues but all resolved now\"},{\"review_id\":\"a0bc9dc6-a5a5-4560-8312-21a9ac284e46\",\"review_text\":\"I'm happy that it has so many odia songs with odia lyrics but I don't understand why their was no option for odia in language section.\"},{\"review_id\":\"af5048de-c13c-4fe8-8bb3-57da703b0c5f\",\"review_text\":\"I'm gonna uninstall this app i hate this new version I can't rewind and so many ads are there too nowadays so many problems are there.\"},{\"review_id\":\"e241a056-de4e-45be-a0a2-a7358071aae6\",\"review_text\":\"I like the app but they should definitely look into making the app free\"},{\"review_id\":\"3f23decf-7de7-4a30-88ab-7364f93fb429\",\"review_text\":\"Ow some.\"},{\"review_id\":\"df715316-f54f-42ae-8006-d9331cc10cca\",\"review_text\":\"Boikot Boikot Boikot\"},{\"review_id\":\"98419bba-8473-4879-bf27-f7d747703168\",\"review_text\":\"La ultima actualización le cambio la estructura amigable a la app. esta versión es ineficiente ya que no puedes controlar tu app como quieres, además de que se desconecta o te deja sin la descarga para escuchar sin internet. Tu MB los puede consumir si no controlas las descargas. Spotify es bueno pero la actualización fue muy mala. No es amigable la navegación.. quizá está más a la \\\"moda\\\" pero se vuelve complicada y más cuando uno va en el auto.\"},{\"review_id\":\"0731231b-8e5e-4422-b325-05edc53eaaba\",\"review_text\":\"Great music ever where I am\"}]}"
